# cine act=rise fx="code:@medal_drop;bg:nike_vs_adidas_clip_panathenaic_stadium;n:4;go:Jesse;lab:BERLIN 1936 · JESSE OWENS;sub:four golds · in Dassler spikes;in:right"
In nineteen thirty-six, Jesse Owens wins four Olympic gold medals in their **spikes**.

