# cine act=setup fx="code:@print_slide;clip:nike_vs_adidas_clip_west_eugene_wetlands;pic:nike_vs_adidas_knight_and_bowerman;go:Phil;side:left;cap:BILL BOWERMAN · PHIL KNIGHT;sub:Blue Ribbon Sports · 1964;in:right"
In nineteen sixty-four, in Oregon, a young runner, Phil Knight, and his coach, Bill Bowerman, start importing Japanese running **shoes**.

